{
  "slug": "cocart-api",
  "name": "Cocart Api",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Official CoCart SDK integration for headless WooCommerce development. Provides accurate SDK installation, configuration, and code patterns across all supported languages and frameworks. Automatically detects your stack and applies the right setup — covering the JS/TS SDK with adapters for Astro, Next.js, Nuxt, SvelteKit, Remix, Hono, Elysia.js, Fastify, and Deno, plus dedicated skills for the PHP, Python, and Go SDKs.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **8 skills**.\n\n- **Skills** (8): `csp` (Generate Content-Security-Policy headers for headless storefronts using CoCart), `flutter` (CoCart Flutter/Dart SDK patterns for headless WooCommerce), `go` (CoCart Go SDK patterns for headless WooCommerce), `js` (CoCart TypeScript/JavaScript SDK patterns for headless WooCommerce), `php` (CoCart PHP SDK patterns for headless WooCommerce), `python` (CoCart Python SDK patterns for headless WooCommerce), `setup` (Main CoCart API setup and integration guidance for headless WooCommerce), `swift` (CoCart Swift SDK patterns for headless WooCommerce)\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install cocart-api@claude-community` from `cocart-headless/claude-plugin`.",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude",
    "copilot",
    "antigravity",
    "codex"
  ],
  "pluginType": "wrapper",
  "wrapper": "skill",
  "sourceType": "community",
